title: Aruba Central: Access Point Status
agents: linux, windows
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Monitors the status an Aruba access point reports to Aruba Central. The
 data reaches Checkmk as a piggyback section of the agent plug-in
 {aruba_central}, so the access point is a host of its own.

 {Up} is OK, {Down} is CRIT and any other status is WARN by default, both
 configurable. Model and firmware version are part of the summary, serial
 number, MAC address, IP address, group, site, mode and the number of
 SSIDs are shown in the service details.

 The section also creates the host labels {aruba/group}, {aruba/site} and
 {aruba/model}, which can be used to sort the access points into folders.

inventory:
 One service per access point.
